      "message": "Since this entire block is coppied 8 times, can we squish it into something nicer? Some helper ulitity class with something like:\n\n```\nclass NewPollingHelper {\n\n  interface Check {\n    void run() throws ExecutionException, InterruptedException;    \n  }\n  \n  static void pollUntilAsserted(timeout, interval, String what, Check check) {\n    dontCatchUncaughtExceptions()\n    .atMost(timeout)\n    .pollInterval(interval)\n    .pollDelay(Duration.ZERO)\n    .untilAsserted(() -\u003e {\n      try {\n        check.run();\n      } catch (ExecutionException e) {\n        throw new AssertionError(\"Failed to \" + what,e);\n      } catch (InterruptedException e) {\n        // This runs on Awaitility\u0027s poll thread, so this only keeps \n        // the interrupt visible there. Consider if it\u0027s really necessary, since \n        // the thread will be thrown away anyway when the wait ends\n        Thread.currentThread().interrupt();\n        \n        throw new IllegalStateException(\"Interrupted while trying to \" + what, e);\n      }  \n    });\n  }\n}\n```",
